; THE CISTERN - where the Mother Stalk is, and the last room of the chapter.
;
; 8 by 6. Open, because a boss fight wants room to move: CORE_RULES.md section 8 gives a Dread a
; phase change at half its Vigor, and a room with nowhere to go turns that into a corner to be
; ground down in rather than a fight that changes shape.
;
; The standing water along the west wall is difficult ground, which is what the two Rabble are
; there to push you into.
;
;   .  floor      ~  difficult ground   #  rock      @  the hero starts
;   1-9 a spawn   |  wall up a line     -  wall along a line   x  door, shut   +  a corner

